        "id": 2940943842,
        "content": "Did some thorough testing (I set up a sandbox environment and everything) this is what the formula is supposed to be. We can normalize the config to multiplier 1 after we enable this. \n```js\nfunction calculateExponentialScore(wordCount: number): number {\n  return Math.pow(wordCount, 0.85) * Math.exp(-wordCount / 100);\n}\n```\nThis is needed for more accurate XP calculation.",
